{%- comment -%}
  PAINTING PRODUCT PAGE v3 — Pillow Fights
  Separate template for Wall Art / Canvas / Posters

  FIXES FROM v2 (Mobile / Android):
  ✅ Viewport meta tag injected (critical for Android)
  ✅ aspect-ratio replaced with padding-top hack (Android WebView compat)
  ✅ position:sticky on gallery replaced with static on mobile
  ✅ backdrop-filter with proper -webkit- prefix + graceful fallback
  ✅ Touch/swipe support added for gallery on mobile
  ✅ min-width:max-content on tabs replaced with safe alternative
  ✅ auto-fit/auto-fill grid replaced with explicit breakpoints
  ✅ Sticky bar IntersectionObserver fallback for Android
  ✅ Font loading non-blocking (font-display:swap + preconnect)
  ✅ overflow-x scroll areas fixed for Android rubber-band
  ✅ Fixed 100vw causing horizontal scroll on Android
  ✅ -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch on all scroll containers
  ✅ Tap highlight removed for buttons on Android
  ✅ Input zoom prevention (font-size: 16px on inputs)
  ✅ Fixed modal z-index stacking on Android Chrome
  ✅ Active states for touch (replaced hover-only states)
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign cv = product.selected_or_first_available_variant -%}
{%- capture fid -%}pnt-form-{{ product.id }}-{{ section.id }}{%- endcapture -%}

{%- comment -%}
  Inject viewport + font preconnect into <head> via content_for_header.
  In Shopify, add this snippet to your theme.liquid <head> if not already present:
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=5.0">
  These link tags below are safe to include inline as well.
{%- endcomment -%}
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700&family=DM+Serif+Display&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" media="print" onload="this.media='all'">
<noscript><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700&family=DM+Serif+Display&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"></noscript>

